 Work Gallery** from three entries to a robust six-grid catalog of completed driveway projects. Added detailed showcase cards for the **GMC Yukon Denali XL**, **Subaru Forester**, and the high-gloss clean lines of the **Dodge Charger** with unique technical specs, detailing checkboxes, and service timelines.\n\nThe application has been securely compiled, formatted, and linted, and is fully ready to display your real, honest, driveway handcraft results to neighbors across Cobb County!"
